<title>UK: UK meals and feed start week higher, but quiet.</title>
<headline>UK meals and feed start week higher, but quiet.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading on the UK meals and feeds market started slowly with higher prices keeping buyers away on Monday.</p>
<p>Gains of around one stg a tonne in high protein soymeal prices were enough to put buyers off.</p>
<p>&quot;We've got the USDA crop report coming out on Wednesday so it's any excuse not to buy until then,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>--Jim Ballantyne, London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8062</p>
